messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 100 and 75? Please reason step by step.', '<think>.\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 100 and 75, we can follow these steps:.\n1. Understand that the product of two numbers is the result of multiplying them together.\n2. Recognize that 100 is a multiple of 10, and 75 is a multiple of 25.\n3. Break down the multiplication into simpler parts to make it easier to compute mentally or on paper.\n4. Use the distributive property of multiplication over addition to simplify the calculation.\n</think>.\n<answer>.\nThe product of 100 and 75 can be calculated as follows:.\n1. We can express 100 as \\(10 \\times 10\\).\n2. We can express 75 as \\(25 \\times 3\\).\n3. Using the distributive property, we can rewrite the product as:.\n   \\[.\n   100 \\times 75 = (10 \\times 10) \\times (25 \\times 3).\n   \\].\n4. We can rearrange the factors to make the multiplication easier:.\n   \\[.\n   (10 \\times 25) \\times (10 \\times 3).\n   \\].\n5. Calculate the products inside the parentheses:.\n   \\[.\n   10 \\times 25 = 250.\n   \\].\n   \\[.\n   10 \\times 3 = 30.\n   \\].\n6. Now, multiply the results of the two products:.\n   \\[.\n   250 \\times 30.\n   \\].\n7. To make this multiplication easier, we can break it down further:.\n   \\[.\n   250 \\times 30 = 250 \\times (3 \\times 10) = (250 \\times 3) \\times 10.\n   \\].\n8. Calculate \\(250 \\times 3\\):.\n   \\[.\n   250 \\times 3 = 750.\n   \\].\n9. Finally, multiply by 10:.\n   \\[. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
